<title>ARGENTINA: Italy's BNL injects $50 mln into Argentine Juncal.</title>
<headline>Italy's BNL injects $50 mln into Argentine Juncal.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Banca Nazionale del Lavoro SpA (BNL) has made a capital injection of $50 million into Argentine insurer Juncal Companias de Seguros, Juncal said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Juncal is controlled by BNL. The injection represents a doubling of Juncal's shareholder equity.</p>
<p>&quot;With this injection, Juncal maintains its important position as the second largest insurer in the country as measured by shareholder equity,&quot; Juncal said in a statement.</p>
<p>It added that the injection will contribute to the insurer's consolidation in the increasingly challenging and competitive Argentine insurance market.</p>
<p>((-- Walter Bianchi, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0633))</p>
